      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — The Archivist.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, hand-authored from the article. XP ledger: level 3, power rating 6 → a level 3 Wizard player-character sheet (a player may take this seat; the authored CR 3 stands in where the ledger is silent). Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>Keeper of Records</strong> — Shadow Estate (independent operator during succession crisis)</p><p>Status: Active — Controls library and information within the Shadow Estate</p><p>The Archivist is a figure of significant influence within the Shadow Estate who controls the library, trades healing for indentured service, and just orchestrated Remi's separation from her allies by threatening to kill them with transformed imps while personally escorting her toward Lyranth's workshop. He 'erased' a toadburt—presumably killing or petrifying them—and smiled as he led Remi to her doom. The Archivist is not just a librarian. The Archivist is a PREDATOR who uses information and institutional position to trap victims.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Paper Cut</strong> — “The Archivist is a figure of significant influence within the Shadow Estate who controls the library, trades healing for indentured service, and just orchestrated Remi's separation from her allies by threatening to kill”</li><li><strong>Keeper of Records</strong> — “He has access to records, documents, and information about the estate's operations and inhabitants.”</li><li><strong>Healing for Indenture</strong> — “The Archivist is a figure of significant influence within the Shadow Estate who controls the library, trades healing for indentured service, and just orchestrated Remi's separation from her allies by threatening to kill”</li><li><strong>Possibly Vampire</strong> — “Unknown — possibly vampire, possibly something else”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/the_archivist</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/the_archivist</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
